{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-maintained: the C++ libraries, runtimes and data FarmSlicer distributes",
    "outside Cargo and npm. 'in' says where each one ships: 'server' = linked into",
    "the server binary (Docker image), 'wasm' = compiled into the browser engine,",
    "'image' = a file in the Docker image, 'browser' = sent to browsers as data.",
    "'harvest' says where harvest-native.mjs finds the licence texts, written to",
    "native/<id>.txt: {orca: path} (a file in the OrcaSlicer submodule; 'header':",
    "only its leading comment, 'lines': [first, last]), {repo: path}, {archive: url,",
    "sha256} (the archive's top-level LICENSE/COPYING/NOTICE files, or 'files'),",
    "{emsdk: path} (a file in emsdk/upstream/emscripten), {emport: name} (that",
    "Emscripten port's cached archive), {ubuntu: package} (its",
    "/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright in the ubuntu:24.04 image).",
    "Server versions follow extern/OrcaSlicer/deps (the Docker orca-deps stage builds",
    "dep_Blosc dep_Boost dep_CGAL dep_Cereal dep_Draco dep_Eigen dep_FREETYPE dep_GMP",
    "dep_JPEG dep_MPFR dep_NLopt dep_OCCT dep_OpenCV dep_OpenEXR dep_OpenVDB dep_PNG",
    "dep_Qhull dep_TBB dep_libnoise; no OpenSSL or curl) and build.rs; wasm versions",
    "follow wasm/toolchain/build-deps.sh and bootstrap.sh. Update this file when",
    "either changes, then run harvest-native.mjs and third-party-notices.mjs."
  ],
